      1 # fixture-app
      1 
      1 A small app used as a fixed file tree for routable-command workloads.
      1 
      1 ## Usage
      1 
      1 Run `main` with CSV lines. Errors are reported through `handleError`.
      1 
      1 ## Notes
      1 
      1 - The limit is fixed at 40.
      1 - See docs/notes.md for the error policy.
